<template><div><h1 id="wiki_key_features">Key Features</h1><section><h2 id="details-setup">Open the carrier and prepare equipment</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-carrier-setup" data-guide-step>Collect an Exo Suit and open the Armory, Cargo Deck, Lift, Moon Pool, Hangar, Bio Lab and Gun Deck routes needed below. Identify upgrade stations and the Armory Teleport Grenade wallbuy. Ordinary bomb-defusal rounds are map objectives, separate from the tablet sequence.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1777.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1777.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Teleport Grenade wallbuy in the Armory&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Teleport Grenade wallbuy in the Armory&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1777&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_main_quest">Main Quest</h1><section><h2 id="details-hidden-generator">Power both disposal machines</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-carrier-chompy" data-guide-step>Activate Chompy in Cargo Deck. As its wall door opens, throw a Teleport Grenade into the small room before the door closes. Once inside, activate the generator; the room soon returns you to the deck.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1779.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1779.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Open room behind Chompy’s wall door&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Open room behind Chompy’s wall door&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1779&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1780.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1780.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Hidden generator inside Chompy’s room&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Hidden generator inside Chompy’s room&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1780&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-carrier-disposals" data-guide-step>The generator activates Weapon Disposal and the special Grenade Disposal puzzle in the Armory. Confirm their lights/power before spending weapons or beginning the icon sequence.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1781.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1781.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Powered Weapon Disposal&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Powered Weapon Disposal&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1781&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1782.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1782.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Activated Grenade Disposal machine&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Activated Grenade Disposal machine&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1782&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-fishing">Build the Gun Deck fishing rod</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-carrier-rod-parts" data-guide-step>Feed Weapon Disposal distinct weapons; repeating a weapon already submitted does not advance its item payout. Its early rewards are the bottle, reel, line and hook. Install each rod part on the Gun Deck rod immediately before claiming another: a new part replaces an uninstalled held part.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1783.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1783.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Gun Deck fishing-rod part mounts&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Gun Deck fishing-rod part mounts&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1783&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-carrier-fish" data-guide-step>After all three parts are fitted, interact with the rod to fish. Rewards are random. Keep the bottle available for the maze and fish for the shovel needed by the island tablet. If aiming for gold, obtain the Red Fish BEFORE completing the maze.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1784.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1784.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Completed Gun Deck fishing rod&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Completed Gun Deck fishing rod&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1784&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-tablet-1">Tablet 1: grenade-icon rows</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-carrier-cycle-icons" data-guide-step>Send a Teleport Grenade into Grenade Disposal to start its icon cycle. Throw actual Contact Grenades into the machine while the required icon is displayed. The names below are machine icons, not a shopping list of different grenades.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1785.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1785.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Frag icon&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Frag icon&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1785&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1786.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1786.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Distraction Drone icon&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Distraction Drone icon&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1786&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1787.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1787.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Nano Swarm icon&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Nano Swarm icon&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1787&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1788.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1788.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Explosive Drone icon&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Explosive Drone icon&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1788&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-carrier-icon-rows" data-guide-step>Complete the rows in order. Each completed row turns green; use that visual confirmation before starting the next. The original tutorial uses Frag as each endpoint; the modern reference also documents Nano Swarm as an endpoint alternative.<ul><li>Row 1: Distraction Drone → Frag.</li><li>Row 2: Explosive Drone → Distraction Drone → Explosive Drone → Frag.</li><li>Row 3: Explosive Drone → Nano Swarm → Explosive Drone → Distraction Drone → Explosive Drone → Frag.</li></ul></li>
<li id="guide-step-carrier-tablet1-deposit" data-guide-step>Take the tablet from the right-hand slot and deposit it at the Gun Deck vault door. If it will not accept the tablet, wait for Oz’s dialogue to finish and interact again.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1789.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1789.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;First tablet at Grenade Disposal&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;First tablet at Grenade Disposal&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1789&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1790.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1790.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Gun Deck vault door accepting tablets&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Gun Deck vault door accepting tablets&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1790&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-tablet-2">Tablet 2: drunk laser maze</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-carrier-maze-ready" data-guide-step>Open every doorway along Cargo Deck → Lift → Moon Pool → Hangar before starting. If attempting gold, have the Red Fish and plan a sub-one-minute run. Drink from the disposal bottle, then activate the keypad outside Cargo Deck.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1791.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1791.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Disposal bottle used to become drunk&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Disposal bottle used to become drunk&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1791&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1792.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1792.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Laser-maze starting keypad&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Laser-maze starting keypad&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1792&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-carrier-maze-cross" data-guide-step>All players cross Cargo Deck, Lift, Moon Pool and Hangar without touching a laser. A laser hit cancels the timer and removes the maze; reactivate the keypad to try again. At the Hangar teleporter, collect the floor tablet and deposit it at the vault.<p class="guide-callout">For the gold attempt, deliberately fail before collecting if the one-minute window will be missed; this preserves another timed attempt in the same match.</p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1794.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1794.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Maze tablet on the Hangar floor&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Maze tablet on the Hangar floor&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1794&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-tablet-3">Tablet 3: repair Bio Lab and dig the island</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-carrier-telefrags" data-guide-step>Kill teleporting zombies or dogs and collect their telefrag pieces promptly; floor drops expire. Carry one piece at a time and install it at the inactive Bio Lab teleporter. After 20 installed pieces the teleporter is usable. Their availability increases later in the match; wait for the relevant enemies instead of assuming every kill can drop one.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1795.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1795.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Telefrag piece dropped by a teleporting enemy&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Telefrag piece dropped by a teleporting enemy&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1795&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1796.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1796.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Inactive Bio Lab teleporter receiving the pieces&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Inactive Bio Lab teleporter receiving the pieces&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1796&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-carrier-island" data-guide-step>Obtain the random fishing shovel, then use the repaired teleporter. Dig around the island until the buried tablet box appears. If forced back before finding it, wait for the teleporter to recharge and repeat. Deposit the tablet at the vault; this unlocks the Gun Deck Mk 25 station.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1797.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1797.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Third tablet in the island’s dug-up box&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Third tablet in the island’s dug-up box&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1797&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1798.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1798.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Gun Deck Mk 25 station unlocked by tablet 3&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Gun Deck Mk 25 station unlocked by tablet 3&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1798&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-tablet-4">Tablet 4: Captain DJ’s eye scanner</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-carrier-locker" data-guide-step>Inspect Captain DJ’s locker near Hangar Exo Medic to hear the eye-scanner clue. After this, a pair of treasure drones can spawn over later rounds. Shoot the EMPTY drone to recover its lever; a normal filled loot drone does not provide this quest item.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1799.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1799.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Captain DJ locker near Hangar Exo Medic&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Captain DJ locker near Hangar Exo Medic&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1799&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1800.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1800.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Empty quest drone dropping the shark-cage lever&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Empty quest drone dropping the shark-cage lever&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1800&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-carrier-cage" data-guide-step>Install the lever in the Moon Pool electrical box beside the printer. Kill zombies around the three floor grates until their blood attracts the swimming shark. When it passes beneath the central opening, pay the box’s 1,000-credit activation and jump onto the cage to descend.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1801.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1801.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Moon Pool lever electrical box&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Moon Pool lever electrical box&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1801&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1802.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1802.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Three grates where blood attracts the shark&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Three grates where blood attracts the shark&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1802&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-carrier-eye" data-guide-step>While the shark attacks the lowered cage, interact with it to collect Captain DJ’s eye. Return to the locker, scan the eye, take the final tablet and deposit it at the Gun Deck vault.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1803.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1803.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Shark below Moon Pool&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Shark below Moon Pool&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1803&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1804.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1804.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Final tablet inside Captain DJ’s locker&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Final tablet inside Captain DJ’s locker&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1804&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-ending">Plant the final C4</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-carrier-c4" data-guide-step>After all four tablets have been deposited, continue submitting weapons to Weapon Disposal until it provides C4. Collect it and interact with the vault to plant it. This immediately commits the squad to the ending and ends the match.<p class="guide-callout">Point of no return: finish optional challenges and upgrades before planting.</p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1805.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1805.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Final C4 supplied by Weapon Disposal&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Final C4 supplied by Weapon Disposal&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1805&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_side_quests">Side Quests</h1><section><h2 id="details-gold">Optional Carrier gold trophy</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-carrier-gold" data-guide-step>Build the rod, obtain tablet 1 and fish a Red Fish. With the Red Fish collected, complete the laser maze in under one minute. Fail deliberately at a laser if the run is too slow so you can retry before accepting tablet 2. The qualifying result awards the gold trophy shown in Descent Reception.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-music">Mars, the Bringer of War music</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-carrier-song" data-guide-step>Activate three toy sharks: on Captain DJ’s Hangar locker by Exo Medic; in the upper Gun Deck corner connecting to Hangar; and on the Lift crane platform above the Exo Reload power wire. The third starts the track.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-mad-hops">Mad Hops shark jumps</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-carrier-shark-jumps" data-guide-step>Feed the Moon Pool grates with kills to attract the swimming shark. As it passes the grate nearest Lift, Exo-jump over it; immediately run into Lift and jump over each of its three shark tanks. Each tank needs its own jump. If the achievement does not trigger, retry while the swimming shark remains or feed the grates again.</li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Source-reviewed on 8 October 2026, using the references below and the research handoff. These instructions and puzzle calculations have software checks; they have not been verified in a complete in-game playthrough. Record symbols, sequences and completion cues from your match. Screenshot and community-chart creators are credited with each illustration.</p><ul><li><a href="https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/carrier/carrier_guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mmmrkennedy illustrated guide ↗</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/CODZombies/comments/3878ck/carrier_easter_egg_thread_spoilers/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">r/CODZombies community guide (2) ↗</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kw33B-41a_Y" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">youtube.com reference (3) ↗</a></li>
